
1. m3_create_tenant.yml
   (will create tenant based upon user input)

2. m3_list_tenants.yml
   (will list tenant names and tenant id)

3. m3_get_tenant_token.yml
   (will get a tenant token and display it)

4. m3_create_bucket.yml
   (first run m3_list_tenants to get the tenant id).
   (then get token based on tenant id and create a bucket)

5. m3_delete_bucket.yml
   (needs tenant id/user/pass and bucketname)

6. m3_delete_tenant.yml
   (needs grid user/pass and tenant id)
